    # MC "I lived up to my end of the deal, now it's time for you to fulfill yours."
    MC "Я выполнил свою часть сделки, теперь твоя очередь выполнить свою."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1819
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_c8e64772:

    # YARRICK @ talk "Lord Zanzibat has {i}already{/i} sent word he wishes to become your patron."
    YARRICK @ talk "Лорд Занзибат {i}уже{/i} передал, что желает стать вашим покровителем."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1820
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_700053ef:

    # MC @ surprised "Really?"
    MC @ surprised "Правда?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1821
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_c417cba1:

    # YARRICK @ smile "After that performance, I don't think there's a merchant in the city who wouldn't consider it."
    YARRICK @ smile "После такого выступления, думаю в городе не найдётся торговца, который бы не задумался об этом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1822
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_e1fb0dbd:

    # MC @ talk "Can you arrange a meeting for me?"
    MC @ talk "Можешь устроить мне встречу?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1823
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_8f2077a6:

    # YARRICK @ smile "Of course!"
    YARRICK @ smile "Конечно!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1824
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_ea844094:

    # YARRICK @ talk "Lord Zanzibat's home can be found outside the Great Palace."
    YARRICK @ talk "Дом Лорда Занзибата находится за пределами Великого Дворца."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1825
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_00a859d9:

    # YARRICK @ talk "It's the great building to the left, with the huge dome on its rooftop... It cannot be missed."
    YARRICK @ talk "Это большое здание слева, с огромным куполом на крыше... Его невозможно не заметить."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1826
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_020a6364:

    # YARRICK @ talk "Be warned... Lord Zanzibat is renowned for his cunning and trickery."
    YARRICK @ talk "Будь осторожен... Лорд Занзибат известен своей хитростью и коварством."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1827
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_83e7f66d:

    # YARRICK @ talk "Even those bastards at the Greater Trading Company tread carefully around him."
    YARRICK @ talk "Даже те ублюдки из Великой Торговой Компании ступают вокруг него осторожно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1828
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_feff2ee5:

    # MC @ serious "Thanks for the advice."
    MC @ serious "Спасибо за совет."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1831
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ReturnToYarrickAfterCaltrack_yarrickreturntalk_6cff1091:

    # MC "(I should head to meet this Lord Zanzibat as soon as possible.)"
    MC "(Мне следует отправиться на встречу с этим Лордом Занзибатом как можно скорее.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1837
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_returnatday_179d89ff:

    # MC "(Not at night.)"
    MC "(Но не ночью.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1844
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_7a49ead3:

    # "As I arrived upon the great entranceway to Lord Zanzibat's home, two guards approached."
    "Когда я прибыл к величественному входу в дом Лорда Занзибата, ко мне подошли двое стражников."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1845
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_45e957f2:

    # GUARD "What business have you here?"
    GUARD "Какие у вас здесь дела?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1847
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_77dae88a:

    # YARRICK @ smile "Ahh, I'm just in time."
    YARRICK @ smile "Ахх, я как раз вовремя."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1848
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_fdfb10ec:

    # YARRICK @ smile "Your master has business here with my client."
    YARRICK @ smile "У вашего господина есть дела с моим клиентом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1849
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_a97d1501:

    # "The guard looked me up and down."
    "Стражник оглядел меня с ног до головы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1850
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_bdeffe71:

    # GUARD "And what business is that?"
    GUARD "И какое именно эти дела?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1851
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_a3b0eb4b:

    # YARRICK @ angry "You're speaking to the savior of Hamun, the beast of Novaras himself boy!"
    YARRICK @ angry "Ты говоришь с самим спасителем Хамуна, зверем Новараса, мальчишка!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1852
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_302828eb:

    # YARRICK @ angry "Do you wish to explain to your master how you turned away such an esteemed guest?"
    YARRICK @ angry "Хочешь объяснить своему господину, как ты отказал такому почётному гостю?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1854
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_9168a9cf:

    # GUARD "... I shall check with Lord Zanzibat."
    GUARD "... Я должен посоветоваться с Лордом Занзибатом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1855
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_d0100793:

    # GUARD "Wait here a moment."
    GUARD "Подождите здесь минутку."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1857
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_637cb91a:

    # YARRICK @ smile "Well, that went better than expected."
    YARRICK @ smile "Что ж, прошло лучше, чем ожидалось."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1859
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_8183380c:

    # MC @ think "Why wouldn't it?"
    MC @ think "А почему бы и нет?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1860
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_3360298a:

    # YARRICK @ think "Lord Zanzibat is... fickle."
    YARRICK @ think "Лорд Занзибат... своенравен."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1861
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_37ef9f55:

    # YARRICK @ think "Many a merchant has tried to meet him only for him to keep changing the time and date."
    YARRICK @ think "Многие купцы пытались встретиться с ним, но он постоянно менял время и дату."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1862
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_e88b8f50:

    # YARRICK @ think "{i}I believe he finds it amusing to see the lengths people will go to speak to him.{/i}"
    YARRICK @ think "{i}Полагаю, ему забавно наблюдать, на какие ухищрения люди готовы пойти чтобы поговорить с ним.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1868
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_700ae275:

    # GUARD "Lord Zanzibat is ready to receive you."
    GUARD "Лорд Занзибат готов принять вас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1869
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_2f76c7a9:

    # "As Yarrick stepped forward, the guard blocked his path."
    "Когда Яррик шагнул вперёд, стражник преградил ему путь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1870
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_ed310237:

    # GUARD "Not you."
    GUARD "Не вы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1871
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_e4e67f64:

    # GUARD "{i}Him.{/i}"
    GUARD "{i}Он.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1872
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_539c85ab:

    # "A disgruntled Yarrick took a step back, flashing me an awkward smile."
    "Недовольный Яррик отступил на шаг, бросив мне неловкую улыбку."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1874
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_cb394247:

    # YARRICK @ smile "I shall see you around I hope?"
    YARRICK @ smile "Надеюсь, мы ещё увидимся?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1875
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_9553e143:

    # YARRICK @ smile "Consider us even now."
    YARRICK @ smile "Теперь мы квиты."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1881
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_3c99283f:

    # "I nodded lightly, before following the guard."
    "Я слегка кивнул, прежде чем последовать за стражником."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1889
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_9dd51684:

    # "Lord Zanzibat's home was unexpected. Ornate, and yet, plants, trees... A flowing stream of water through the centre."
    "Дом Лорда Занзибата оказался неожиданным. Изысканный, и при этом, растения, деревья... Текучий ручей воды по центру."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1890
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_4502d254:

    # "It was more like standing inside a garden in the middle of the desert than it was a home."
    "Это было больше похоже на сад посреди пустыни, чем на жилище."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1891
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_0de86d18:

    # "As I heard the clap of hands, I turned towards Lord Zanzibat."
    "Услышав хлопок в ладоши, я повернулся к Лорду Занзибату."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1894
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_813bc6bc:

    # "Lord Zanzibat was not a towering figure, rather he was skinny, almost effeminate."
    "Лорд Занзибат не был высоким, скорее он был худощавым, почти женственным."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1895
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_f215eac7:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "I had many of them imported from Sylvania."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Я привез многих из них из Сильвании."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1896
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_1dce7595:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "It cost me a fortune of course, but..."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Это стоило мне целое состояние конечно, но..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1897
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_e2b29dc5:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "I find they bring me great comfort."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Они приносят мне большой комфорт."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1898
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_95ffb076:

    # MC @ talk "Lord Zanzibat."
    MC @ talk "Лорд Занзибат."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1900
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_5033cf1d:

    # "I gave a curtly bow."
    "Я сделал короткий поклон."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1901
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_938a175d:

    # MC @ talk "You honour me with this meeting."
    MC @ talk "Вы оказываете мне честь этой встречей."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1902
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_7d53c472:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Well, how could I resist a chance to meet the saviour of Novaras?"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Ну, как я мог упустить шанс встретиться со спасителем Новараса?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1903
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_9421f81a:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "And especially after that arena performance..."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "И особенно после того выступления на арене..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1904
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_06bfc572:

    # MC @ smile "It was a little closer than I would have liked."
    MC @ smile "Это было немного ближе, чем мне бы хотелось."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1905
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_192088ef:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "Mmm... I did think for a moment your blood might spill on the sands."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Ммм... Я на мгновение подумал, что твоя кровь может пролиться на пески."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1906
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_f00b249b:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "But that rage at the end... It was..."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Но та ярость в конце... Это было..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1907
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_88c629bd:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "Spectacular."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Великолепно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1908
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_d96919ec:

    # "That rage... That blinding hot rage where my body moved without me, where the dark passenger – Shyahtan or whatever his name was, took full control."
    "Та ярость... Та ослепляющая горячая ярость, когда моё тело двигалось без моего участия, когда тёмный пассажир – Шьяхтан или как там его зовут, взял полный контроль."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1909
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_530f4eb0:

    # "I couldn't help but feel... Uncomfortable by the thought."
    "Я не мог не почувствовать... Неловкость от этой мысли."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1910
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_6549fa11:

    # MC @ talk "... I've come here to ask something of you."
    MC @ talk "... Я пришёл сюда, чтобы попросить вас кое о чём."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1911
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_e858e11e:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "Oh, this is a first."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Оу, это впервые."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1912
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_6b05abff:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Normally, I make the offer and let you think on it."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Обычно я делаю предложение и даю тебе подумать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1913
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_8997b2f2:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Now you have my attention, what is it you want?"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Теперь ты привлёк моё внимание, чего же ты хочешь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1914
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_d934f6d3:

    # MC @ talk "You're one of the last barriers blocking the deal between Novaras and the Greater Trading Company... I want you to let it pass."
    MC @ talk "Вы — один из последних барьеров, мешающих сделке между Новарасом и Великой Торговой Компанией... Я хочу, чтобы вы пропустили её."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1915
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_443ecd71:

    # "Lord Zanzibat considered my words carefully as he slowly paced around the room, gently brushing his hand along one of the plants."
    "Лорд Занзибат тщательно обдумывал мои слова, медленно прохаживаясь по комнате и нежно проводя рукой по одному из растений."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1916
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_61aa857f:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Tell me... do you know why Hamun is still free?"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Скажи... ты знаешь, почему Хамун всё ещё свободен?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1917
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_37dad121:

    # MC @ talk "Because no side dares try to conquer it yet?"
    MC @ talk "Потому что ни одна сторона ещё не осмелилась его завоевать?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1918
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_f7524e3f:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "In part. But the truth is simpler: Hamun sells its table to *all* sides, and takes none."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Отчасти. Но правда проще: Хамун продаёт свой стол *всем* сторонам и не принимает ничью."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1919
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_c0766e48:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "Kings, rebels, merchants, priests, each can bargain here."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Короли, повстанцы, купцы, жрецы — каждый может торговаться здесь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1920
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_0ae0fa98:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "That is our shield."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Это наш щит."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1921
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_bfc3b19b:

    # ZANZIBAT @ serious "The Greater Trading Company would break that balance."
    ZANZIBAT @ serious "Великая Торговая Компания разрушит этот баланс."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1922
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_c263fb66:

    # ZANZIBAT @ serious "They are not merchants, they are parasites."
    ZANZIBAT @ serious "Они не купцы, они паразиты."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1923
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_686f45a6:

    # ZANZIBAT @ serious "Once they take root, they twist every throne they touch."
    ZANZIBAT @ serious "Как только они укоренятся, они искривят каждый трон, к которому прикоснутся."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1924
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_86307e7e:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Do you know the fate of the People of Wei?"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Знаешь ли ты судьбу народа Вэй?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1925
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_11d4edaf:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "In less than fifty years, the GTC bought their land, scattered their bloodline, and sold the survivors on the backs of Paruh beasts."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Менее чем за пятьдесят лет ВТК выкупила их земли, разбросала их род и продала выживших на спинах Парухских зверей."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1926
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_e72be1c9:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "So tell me... why should I welcome that fate here?"
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Так скажи мне... почему я должен приветствовать такую судьбу здесь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1933
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_350fd090:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "It shall, but it's the difference between the deal passing in the next three months and the next three years."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Она будет, но разница в том, пройдёт ли сделка в ближайшие три месяца или в ближайшие три года."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1937
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_d3c8843a:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "I have had dealings with them in the past."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "У меня были с ними дела в прошлом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1938
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_d466e272:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "None of which have ended well... For anyone involved."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Ни одно из которых не закончилось хорошо... Для всех участников."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1939
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_8de44649:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "You would do well to be parted from their 'business' as soon as you can."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Тебе бы стоило как можно скорее отойти от их 'бизнеса'."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1944
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_3f011ce2:

    # MC "Then what would it take to persuade you?"
    MC "Тогда что потребуется, чтобы убедить вас?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1945
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_c21c67dc:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "... Hmm."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "... Хм."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1946
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_9fdbb0e5:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "The shipping rights."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Права на судоходство."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1947
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_bde6c2b6:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "Что?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1948
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_9e7a2320:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "I want them to agree to only use my ships to transport the goods from Alderay to Skarshire and vice versa."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Я хочу, чтобы они согласились использовать только мои корабли для перевозки товаров из Алдерея в Скаршир, и обратно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1949
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_3f36b076:

    # MC @ serious "For someone so against them, you seem more than ready to jump into business with them again."
    MC @ serious "Для того, кто так против них, вы кажется более чем готовы снова заняться с ними бизнесом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1950
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_483cf438:

    # ZANZIBAT @ smile "It's as the old proverb says."
    ZANZIBAT @ smile "Как говорится в старой пословице."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1951
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_f5dd4b8d:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "{i}Keep your friends close, and keep your enemies even closer.{/i}"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "{i}Держи друзей близко, а врагов — ещё ближе.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1952
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_a872cabc:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "Tell the GTC my answer."
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "Передай ВТК мой ответ."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1954
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_ZanzibatHouse_zanzitalk_a72b3584:

    # ZANZIBAT @ talk "{i}I will expect the agreement in writing... and on their god.{/i}"
    ZANZIBAT @ talk "{i}Я ожидаю соглашение в письменном виде... и на их бога.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1962
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_0a1e03ae:

    # GAREN "Can I help you with something?"
    GAREN "Я могу тебе чем-то помочь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1965
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_66b0402a:

    # GAREN @ think "Go on?"
    GAREN @ think "Продолжай?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1966
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_fb0e6d2b:

    # MC @ talk "He will step aside and allow the deal to pass {i}if{/i} his ships are used to transport the cargo to and from Skarshire."
    MC @ talk "Он отступит и позволит сделке состояться {i}при условии{/i}, что его корабли будут использоваться для перевозки грузов в Скаршир и обратно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1967
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_995dd8b9:

    # GAREN @ smile "... Very well, I shall arrange the papers for him."
    GAREN @ smile "... Хорошо, я подготовлю для него документы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1968
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_4ee67eb4:

    # MC @ think "Just like that?"
    MC @ think "Вот так просто?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1969
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_4fb6e909:

    # MC @ think "No bartering, no negotiation?"
    MC @ think "Никакого торга, никаких переговоров?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1970
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_d8251d85:

    # GAREN @ smile "The desert fox has made his offer."
    GAREN @ smile "Пустынный лис сделал своё предложение."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1971
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_58c3d475:

    # GAREN @ smile "I am sure he will obsess over every word of the papers I send, but within a few days at the most we will conclude our business."
    GAREN @ smile "Я уверен, он будет одержимо изучать каждое слово в документах, которые я отправлю, но максимум через несколько дней мы завершим нашу сделку."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1972
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_edbe0460:

    # MC @ talk "How can you be so sure?"
    MC @ talk "Как ты можешь быть так уверен?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1973
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_00346b84:

    # GAREN @ talk "Because despite his hatred of us, he's always more than willing to do business with us."
    GAREN @ talk "Потому что, несмотря на свою ненависть к нам, он всегда более чем готов иметь с нами дело."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1974
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_11568e73:

    # GAREN @ talk "It is a game to him, I believe, to see if he can outsmart us."
    GAREN @ talk "Думаю, для него это игра — проверить, сможет ли он перехитрить нас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1975
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_69989a6a:

    # MC @ think "If you're just giving him everything he wants, doesn't that mean he's already won?"
    MC @ think "Если ты просто отдаёшь ему всё что он хочет, разве это не значит, что он уже победил?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1976
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_903ddcb0:

    # GAREN @ smile "{i}Only if he can keep to his end of the bargain.{/i}"
    GAREN @ smile "{i}Только если он сможет выполнить свою часть сделки.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1977
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_2192f037:

    # MC @ think "What do you mean by that?"
    MC @ think "Что ты имеешь в виду?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1978
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_252641ae:

    # GAREN @ talk "{i}We are bound only by the wording of our contract... Nothing more.{/i}"
    GAREN @ talk "{i}Мы связаны только формулировками нашего контракта... Ничем более.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1979
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_6a444706:

    # GAREN @ smile "If you have a moment, I could humour you with a tale."
    GAREN @ smile "Если у тебя есть минутка, я мог бы рассказать тебе одну историю."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1982
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_2cff701a:

    # GAREN @ talk "There was once a lord who swore, if we armed him and filled his ranks with our mercenaries, he would crush his rival within the year."
    GAREN @ talk "Жил-был лорд, который поклялся, что если мы вооружим его и пополним его ряды нашими наёмниками, он разгромит своего соперника в течение года."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1983
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_6884319c:

    # GAREN @ talk "Payment was guaranteed. And if not, his castle would be ours."
    GAREN @ talk "Оплата была гарантирована. А если нет — его замок переходил к нам."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1984
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_4dd2ec1a:

    # GAREN @ talk "A bold deal. Too bold. Because his rival came to us with the very same request."
    GAREN @ talk "Смелая сделка. Слишком смелая. Потому что его соперник обратился к нам с точно такой же просьбой."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1985
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_e47a45b8:

    # MC @ surprised "Surely that's a conflict of interest?"
    MC @ surprised "Неужели это не конфликт интересов?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1986
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_869b5883:

    # GAREN @ smile "Not if the contract doesn't forbid it."
    GAREN @ smile "Нет, если контракт этого не запрещает."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1987
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_ff958f57:

    # GAREN @ talk "So we sold both sides weapons. We took both their coin. And when their coffers ran dry... we took collateral."
    GAREN @ talk "Так что мы продали оружие обеим сторонам. Мы взяли деньги с обоих. И когда их казны опустели... мы взяли залог."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1988
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_f88c955e:

    # GAREN @ talk "First land. Then blood. Piece by piece, both lords fed us their realms rather than admit defeat."
    GAREN @ talk "Сначала землю. Затем кровь. Часть за частью оба лорда скормили нам свои владения, лишь бы не признать поражение."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1989
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_5078ca82:

    # GAREN @ smile "By the second year, neither could pay another coin. One was hanged in the square. The other drowned in his own bath."
    GAREN @ smile "К второму году, ни один из них не смог заплатить ни монеты. Один был повешен на площади. Другой утонул в собственной ванне."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1990
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_0f8d033b:

    # MC @ scared "... That's monstrous."
    MC @ scared "... Это чудовищно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1991
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_564c8dd2:

    # GAREN @ think "Is it? They could have stopped. Pride kept them blind."
    GAREN @ think "Разве? Они могли остановиться. Гордыня ослепляла их."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1992
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_14d8e3ee:

    # GAREN @ smile "That is the true lesson: greed makes men puppets, and we hold the strings."
    GAREN @ smile "Вот истинный урок: жадность делает людей марионетками, а мы дергаем за ниточки."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1996
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_106b3d3e:

    # GAREN @ smile "Of course, another time perhaps."
    GAREN @ smile "Конечно, возможно в другой раз."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2000
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_cd7f5b31:

    # GAREN @ talk "Until the ink meets the page then."
    GAREN @ talk "До тех пор, пока чернила не коснутся страницы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2003
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_e8b55b4e:

    # GAREN @ smile "You have done well here."
    GAREN @ smile "Ты хорошо справился здесь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2004
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_d452e86b:

    # MC @ think "All this trouble... Why not just ask Lord Zanzibat yourselves?"
    MC @ think "Все эти хлопоты... Почему бы вам самим не спросить Лорда Занзибата?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2005
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_7ee32d5e:

    # MC @ think "Why use me?"
    MC @ think "Зачем использовать меня?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2006
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_b540657a:

    # GAREN @ talk "Because Lord Zanzibat only plays the {i}great game{/i} on his terms."
    GAREN @ talk "Потому что Лорд Занзибат играет в {i}великую игру{/i} только на своих условиях."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2007
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_d1abcf29:

    # GAREN @ talk "He would {i}expect{/i} some kind of enticing offer to even bring him to the table."
    GAREN @ talk "Он бы {i}ожидал{/i} какого-то заманчивого предложения, чтобы вообще сесть за стол переговоров."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2008
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_d6e1ac52:

    # GAREN @ talk "...And."
    GAREN @ talk "...И."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2009
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_4e56044d:

    # "Garen's face slowly shifts into a smile without any warmth."
    "Лицо Гарена медленно расплывается в улыбке, лишённой всякого тепла."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2010
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_83130464:

    # GAREN @ smile "The Greater Trading Company is always looking for new assets."
    GAREN @ smile "Великая Торговая Компания всегда ищет новые активы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2011
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_8455a15f:

    # GAREN @ smile "{i}You are so far proving yourself a valuable asset.{/i}"
    GAREN @ smile "{i}До сих пор, ты доказывал что являешься ценным активом.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2012
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_9429e63d:

    # GAREN @ talk "I shall return soon after I handle Lord Zanzibat."
    GAREN @ talk "Я вернусь вскоре после того, как разберусь с Лордом Занзибатом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2013
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_736ebcd9:

    # MC @ think "What am I to do until then?"
    MC @ think "Что мне делать до тех пор?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2014
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_a513ccf1:

    # GAREN @ talk "Whatever you so desire."
    GAREN @ talk "Что пожелаешь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2015
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_f1c8b685:

    # GAREN @ talk "{i}... The GTC is pleased with your progress.{/i}"
    GAREN @ talk "{i}... ВТК довольна твоими успехами.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2016
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_2cc04117:

    # GAREN @ talk "{i}Good work.{/i}"
    GAREN @ talk "{i}Хорошая работа.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2018
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_1a65813e:

    # "With a small, curtly tilt of his head towards me, Garen Quiltshire left {i}The Pale Dragon.{/i}"
    "С небольшим, сдержанным наклоном головы в мою сторону, Гарен Квилтшир покинул {i}Бледного Дракона.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2019
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_d47561b9:

    # "Once more, leaving me without direction."
    "Снова, оставив меня без направления."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:2020
translate ru qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_TalkToGarenBar_695d4c57:

    # "As I stood there directionless I felt the brush of a soft hand on the back of my arm."
    "Пока я стоял там, не зная куда идти, я почувствовал прикосновение мягкой руки к тыльной стороне моей руки."

